<title>SPAIN: SOCCER SHOWCASE-BARCELONA AND ATLETICO MADRID DRAW 3-3.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-BARCELONA AND ATLETICO MADRID DRAW 3-3.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA, Spain 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Spanish first</p>
<p>division match played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Barcelona 3 (Juan Pizzi 15th, Luis Enrique Martinez 29th,</p>
<p>Giovanni 78th) Atletico Madrid 3 (Jose Luis Caminero 6th, Juan</p>
<p>Vizcaino 60th, Juan Esnaider 73rd pen.)</p>
<p>Halftime 2-1</p>
<p>Attendance: 106,000</p>
</text>
